Gold is useful for points, in the end.  Thing is that gems are usually
worth (in score value) more than their weight in gold.  In other
words: stock up on gems, ditch the gold.  If you just have spare cash
and you're not burdened when you hit up the elements, pick up a few
piles until you're burdened, drop until you're unburdened, before
walking upstairs (just to get the easy extra score).

Fact is, unless you've shops to buy stuff from, your gold has little/
no usefulness.

Oh.  If you have levitation, throwing GP may let you travel through
the air.

